# hilavitkutin-api

The legacy contract: kept until the engine is ported onto `hilavitkutin-contracts`, and then removed. New work is written against `hilavitkutin-contracts`.

Consumer-facing types, traits, and platform contracts for the
hilavitkutin pipeline execution engine. Consumers write WorkUnits
against this crate and pipe diagnostics / byte output through the
capability / sink / codec contracts. `#![no_std]`, no alloc.
